    {
      "_id": "YHDbjzzR4ad8Ykij",
      "name": "Crimson Ooze",
      "type": "action",
      "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp",
      "effects": [],
      "folder": null,
      "sort": 300000,
      "flags": {
        "core": {}
      },
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The horror tree's branches are encrusted with Crimson Ooze, a virulent fungus that grows rapidly when in contact with blood, sending filaments ripping through the bodies of any living creatures damaged by its branches.</p>\n<p>This devastating fungus infects your hand and can be cured by amputating the limb before you reach stage 4.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong>&nbsp;@Check[type:fortitude|dc:34]</p>\n<hr style=\"border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-light-primary); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border-light-highlight);\" />\n<p><strong>Stage 1</strong>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14);\">@Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{Clumsy}</span><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14);\"> (1 day)</span></p>\n<p><strong>Stage 2</strong>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14);\">@Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{Clumsy&nbsp;2}</span><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14);\"> and using the infected hand deals 3d6 persistent bleed damage&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14);\">(1 day)</span></p>\n<p><strong>Stage 3</strong>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14);\">@Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{Clumsy&nbsp;2}</span><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14);\"> and @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 2}, the infected hand is unusable (1day)&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14);\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><strong>Stage 4&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14);\">@Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{Clumsy&nbsp;3}</span><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14);\"> and @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 3}, the infected hand is permanently unusable (1day)</span><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14);\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><strong>Stage 5 </strong>@Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.LiGbewa9pO0yjbsY]{Confusion} and damage does not end the confused condition (1 day)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 6 death</strong></p>"
        },
        "source": {
          "value": "Gamemastery Guide pg. 119"
        },
